WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.426
Lord Cob.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:10.468
Enter.

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:19.019
Forgive my intrusion.
I beg leave to speak.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.146
What is it?

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:24.149
I'm afraid some of our slaves escaped.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:29.154
I see. You let my precious merchandise go.

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:32.949
No. We've captured most of them.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.159
And?

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.163
What about the others?

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:42.167
We're scouring the countryside.
We'll find them.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.171
You're a fool.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:50.216
Do you think I can't manage without you?

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:59.726
It was a wizard!
A wizard with a scar on his face!

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.227
What?

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:04.731
A scar on his face?

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:10.528
It's Sparrowhawk.
The Archmage pays me a visit.

00:01:11.362 --> 00:01:14.491
Find him for me, Hare... or else.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:17.035
I won't fail you, my lord.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.378
I've waited long
for this day... Sparrowhawk.

